msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

msgid ""
"Install Miniforge, Miniconda, or Anaconda to get Conda. From a terminal, clone the repository and"
" create the project environment."
msgstr "安装 Miniforge、Miniconda 或 Anaconda 以获得 Conda。在终端克隆仓库并创建项目环境。"

msgid ""
"Conda installs Python 3.12 and the dependencies in ``environment.yml``. Pip installs the package "
"in editable mode, so changes to the source code take effect without reinstalling."
msgstr "Conda 安装 Python 3.12 和 ``environment.yml`` 中的依赖；Pip 以 editable 模式安装本包，源码修改无需重新安装即可生效。"

msgid "Run a smoke test to verify the installation."
msgstr "运行 smoke test 检查安装。"

msgid "When the environment definition changes, update it from the repository root."
msgstr "环境定义发生变化时，在仓库根目录执行更新。"

msgid ""
"You can read the notebook in :doc:`tutorials/index` in a browser. To run it interactively, "
"install JupyterLab in the activated environment."
msgstr "可以在浏览器阅读 :doc:`tutorials/index` 中的 notebook。如需交互运行，在已激活的环境中安装 JupyterLab。"
